  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note records the decision that the scheduler leader lease will be shortened to ten seconds, and when was it written?\n[2026-05-19] incident-review/INC-2026-009: Incident review INC-2026-009. The scheduler ran the nightly jobs twice on 2026-05-16. Root cause: two leaders elected during a network partition. Decision: the scheduler leader lease will be shortened to ten seconds, because two leaders ran the nightly jobs twice in INC-2026-009. [2025-06-06] standup/ember/2025-06-06: Decided in today's standup: the scheduler will use leader election instead of a single fixed node, since the fixed node turned every restart into a missed run. [2025-09-05] standup/dune/2025-09-05: The Dune team still owns the scheduler, in case anyone asks.",
